vulkan-systems

Independent C++17 VulkanWrapper and CPU modules. Each directory owns its
source, public .hpp headers, and build.c; there is no combined engine.

gpu       GPU buffers, images, descriptors, compute, resource graph
render    Frame scheduling, targets, pipelines, draw and postprocess
bvh       GPU BVH and TLAS/BLAS ray traversal
lumen     Cornell GI: surface cards, probes, reflections
pcloud    Point-cloud GI, BVH shadows, point-light BRDF, tonemapping
pmap      Photon mapping, caustics, surface GI and filtered soft shadows
spatial   CPU spatial BVH and indexed neighborhoods
network   DTLS-secured datagrams and reliable transport
jobs      Worker scheduling and main-thread completion
editor    Editor input/UI and optional Vulkan drawing
